  "content": "\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/compatible_with-26.1_|_1.21_|_1.20_|_1.19_|_1.18_|_1.17_|_1.16-blue?style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"\" width=\"468\" height=\"28\"></p>\n<h1><strong>更好的灯笼 v1.3</strong></h1>\n<p><strong>现已兼容新增的铜灯笼与铁链！</strong></p>\n<hr>\n<p>此资源包为<strong>灯笼</strong>和<strong>铁链</strong>添加了<strong>3D模型</strong>并赋予其清爽的外观。此外，它还调整了<strong>第三人称</strong>视角下的<strong>手持</strong>方式，使其更加美观且略带真实感。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/614/321/huge_2023-01-29_19.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"3840\" height=\"2160\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1342/436/2025-09-30_20-02-52-png.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"3840\" height=\"2160\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/711/589/huge_2023-01-29_19.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"3840\" height=\"2160\"></p>\n<h2><strong>🌟模组支持（始于 1.2 及以上版本）</strong></h2>\n<hr>\n<table style=\"width:23.6842%;border-width:1px\">\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:64.5587%;border-width:1px\"><strong>模组</strong></th>\n<th style=\"width:17.4355%;border-width:1px\"><strong>1.20</strong></th>\n<th style=\"width:17.4355%;border-width:1px\"><strong>1.21</strong></th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:64.5587%;border-width:1px\"><strong><a rel=\"nofollow\">Arcane Lanterns</a></strong></td>\n<td style=\"width:17.4355%;border-width:1px\">✅</td>\n<td style=\"width:17.4355%;border-width:1px\">✅</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:64.5587%;border-width:1px\"><strong><a rel=\"nofollow\">Thin Air</a></strong></td>\n<td style=\"width:17.4355%;border-width:1px\">✅</td>\n<td style=\"width:17.4355%;border-width:1px\">✅</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>🔻1.2 及更早版本</strong></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/compatible_with-1.21_|_1.20_|_1.19_|_1.18_|_1.17_|_1.